OL,3,GNEWSAWinter fuel cuts turned the Welsh
OL,4,Aagainst Labour, former leader Neil
OL,5,AKinnock says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Labour leader Neil Kinnock says
OL,8,Fthe party's welfare policies turned
OL,9,Fdisillusionment with Labour in Wales
OL,10,Finto "active dislike".
OL,12,FHe said that UK government decisions on
OL,13,Fbenefits and winter fuel payments had
OL,14,Fdriven voters in Wales away from the
OL,15,FWelsh arm of the party before the
OL,16,Fcountry's Senedd election in May.
OL,18,FLord Kinnock made the comments as part
OL,19,Fof a Newyddion S4C YouTube special on
OL,20,FAndy Burnham's first 100 days as prime
OL,21,Fminister.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
